{
  "about": "The system map a PR body draws (informative-prs/01, scripts/pr-map.mjs). Areas are listed in map order; every git-tracked file belongs to exactly one area (scripts/pr-map.test.mjs). Inside an area a module is a file (its tests fold into it) unless the path sits under one of the area's folders, where each child folder is one module. Links are the dependencies imports can't show: from depends on to.",
